<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12748"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Johno<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Johno<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, April 08, 2005 - 3:14 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Phoenix, Here is link to very informative website on the subject of serial killers: <BR> <BR><a href="http://www.serial-killer.org/index.php" target=_top>http://www.serial-killer.org/index.php</a><!--/Text--></td></tr>
