</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Bmodule<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, April 09, 2005 - 9:53 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Once more...From Denmark...via Radio Free Kansas...Here&#39;s SKOV: <BR> <BR>Hi All you great sleuths... <BR>  <BR>Humble I´ll contribute to this thred...with my last post... <BR>  <BR>What is the mantra of today´s western world?...FREEDOM...but freedom to what? <BR>  <BR>&#34;freedom´s just another word for nothing left to lose...&#34; Janis Joplin sang... <BR>  <BR>If your soul has lost the light of genuine love, it has only the power of darkness, your soul is left empty , you have nothing left to loose...the reptile takes over...it feels the need to kill, it feels free to kill...it kills... <BR>  <BR> In 1966 a man of the name Anton Szandor LaVey started a new church in the US, the name of the chuch was &#34;Church of Satan&#34;, in 1969 he wrote a book, the name of the book was &#34;The Satanic Bible&#34;...I would say he promoted one way of the philosophy of freedom ... <BR>&#34;My worst enemies are those who presume me to be harmless. They cannot imagine how much I resent and disdain them, or just how great a threat they would face if I could get at them. Everything in their behavior speaks of insult and presumptuousness, and for now it is all I can do to make constructive use of my anger toward them. At this time, I just make a list of them and keep a watch on. Some day, with the help of time, space, and circumstance, I will be able to humiliate them properly - not in a manner they would enjoy, but in a style calculated to make them wish that they had never been born&#34;....this was stated by Anton Szandor LaVey <BR> <BR>   <BR>I´m not saying that serial killers are satanists, all I´m saying is, they suffer from the same empty soul, are driven by the same power of darkness...they have nothing left to lose... <BR>...it could happen to you, it could happen to me, if we totaly loose the light of genuine love...think about it...research it...beware of it...BIG TIME... <BR>  <BR>I have been banned from the forum for about 3-4 weeks now, I say hugs and goodbye to all my dear friends here at catchbtk.com, it has been more than a pleassure to know &#40;most&#41; you... <BR>  <BR>God bless you all... <BR>  <BR>skov <BR> <BR> <BR>Editor&#39;s Note:  We are hoping to get things straightened out so that Skov will rejoin the fold. Until then, Skov has found some other info and emailed it to me &#40;and possibly some of you&#41; that is probably the first new info I&#39;ve run across in a week or two and well worth looking into. Once I&#39;ve done some preliminary research I will be passing it on to the board. <BR> <BR>bmodule<!--/Text--></td></tr>
