</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Bmodule<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, April 11, 2005 - 5:59 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Some more from Skov: <BR> <BR>Some other info I found was this, I havent seen this info posted on any forums either: <BR>  <BR><a href="http://www.arkvalleynews.com/web/isite.dll?1110383208618~rader" target=_top>http://www.arkvalleynews.com/web/isite.dll?1110383 208618~rader</a> <BR>  <BR>Feb. 28--Officers Terrell Brown and Kevin Werlein assisted members of the Rader family as they collected belongings at 6314 N. Jacksonville, then escorted them from the residence to the bank and just south of the Park City limits, at the request of Police Chief William Ball. <BR>  <BR>Dietz, P Hmore info <BR>6314 Jacksonville Dr <BR>Park City, KS 67219 <BR>&#40;316&#41; 744-2117 <BR> <BR><a href="http://66.102.9.104/search?q=cache:P4_oDqeQ3gEJ:www.berschauer.com/Genealogy/Total/1500.htm%2B%226314%2B%2BJacksonville%2BDr%22%2Cpark%2Bcity%2Cks&amp;hl=en" target=_top>http://66.102.9.104/search?q=cache:P4_oDqeQ3gEJ:ww w.berschauer.com/Genealogy/Total/1500.htm&#43;%226314&#43; &#43;Jacksonville&#43;Dr%22,park&#43;city,ks&amp;hl=en</a> <BR> <BR>Family 1574.  Hugo Palmer Dietz &#34;Palmer&#34;, s of Otto Dietz &amp; Anna Elisabeth Fabrizius &#40;Family 1573&#41;, b 1 Feb 1923 WaKeeney Trego Co KS.  He m 25 Sep 1946 to Eileen Howard.  She b 11 May 1926.  They have 3 dau: <BR> <BR>    i Paula Dietz, 1948-.  See Family 1575. <BR> <BR>   ii Sharon Dietz, 1949-.  See Family 1576. <BR> <BR>  iii Donna Dietz, 1951-.  See Family 1577. <BR> <BR>Res: Wichita KS.  Add: 6314 Jacksonville Dr, Wichita KS 67219. [2p139;86p106] <BR> <BR>  <BR> <BR>  <BR> <BR>Family 1575.  Paula Dietz, dau of Hugo Palmer Dietz &#34;Palmer&#34; &amp; Eileen Howard &#40;Family 1574&#41;, b 5 May 1948.  She m 22 May 1971 to Dennis L. Rader.  He b 9 Mar 1945.  They have 2 ch: <BR> <BR>    i Brian Howard Rader, b 27 Jul 1975 Wichita Sedgwick Co KS. [2p139;86p106] <BR> <BR>   ii Kerri Lynn Rader, b 13 Jun 1978 Wichita Sedgwick Co KS. [2p139;86p106] <BR> <BR>[2p139;86p106;86ap14] <BR> <BR>Family 1708.  Harlan Dean Elsasser, s of Alvin Adam Elsasser &amp; Rosa Irene Ochs &#40;Family 1706&#41;, b 13 Jan 1940 Great Bend KS; bapt 4 Feb 1940 St Johns Lutheran Church Russell Russell Co KS; conf 30 May 1954 St Johns Lutheran Church Russell Russell Co KS; educ: Univ of Kansas.  He 1m 28 Aug 1960 to Barbara Lee Rader.  She b 21 May 1941 Minneapolis Hennepin Co MN.  They have 3 ch: <BR> <BR>    i Steven Dean Elsasser &#34;Steve&#34;, b 11 Oct 1961 Dodge City Ford Co KS.  Res: Snohomish WA.  Add: 23611 138th Dr SE, Snohomish WA 98296-7812. [85p13] <BR> <BR>   ii Cynthia Dee Elsasser &#34;Cindy&#34;, b 9 Nov 1963 Lawrence Douglass Co KS. [85p13] <BR> <BR>  iii Scott Adam Elsasser, b 18 Jul 1966 Everett WA. [85p13] <BR> <BR>They div.  He 2m 6 Jul 1976 to Lonna Maria Abeyta.  She b 12 Jun 1952 Yakima Yakima Co WA.  They have 1 s: <BR> <BR>    i Jason Randel Elsasser, b 19 Feb 1969 Seattle King Co WA. [85p13] <BR> <BR>Res: Colville WA.  Add: 381 Douglas Falls Rd, Colville WA 99114-8635. [6ap159;6b;85p13;98p145] <BR> <BR>Apparently the Wife and others were given police protection while gathering belongings from her parents home before leaving town. <BR> <BR>I wonder if her parents &#40;or one of&#41; are still living or whether the house was used for storage?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
