<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12832"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Bluepup<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Bluepup<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, April 12, 2005 - 5:02 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->BMod.. <BR>first, you have no direct knowledge that any of them knew, and just because you think they should have known, does NOT mean that they DID know. second, those phone #&#39;s and addresses are not of his immediate family members, not people that lived in his household. &#39;nuff said.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
