</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Vscantu<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, April 13, 2005 - 11:05 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Great to see my 3 FAVORITE POSTERS weighing in on this Thread: STEVE HUFF, JOHNO &amp; LOSTDOG!!! You boys Rock!! <BR> <BR>Bmodule: you&#39;re also right up there, but you have to Slow Down! <BR> <BR>I am preparing my Nobel acceptance speech as we speak! &#40;just kidding&#41;.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
