<!--Post: 12866--><!--Time: 1113463091-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12866"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Steve_huff<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Steve_huff<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, April 14, 2005 - 12:18 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Well, if we were going to just go ahead and wax old testament, that would be a pretty appropriate way to do it.  <BR> <BR>The Iranians publicly flog their serial killers and then hang &#39;em high. Maybe there is something to learn there. As far as we know, Iran doesn&#39;t have too many serial killers.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 12866-->
<!--Post: 12867--><!--Time: 1113463220-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12867"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:bmodule_244@hotmail.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Bmodule<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Bmodule<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, April 14, 2005 - 12:20 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Seeing as there are weeks if not months if not years before the actual trial starts and some new facts come to light&#40;don&#39;t miss the arraignment this next Tuesday&#41;, and I find myself starting to blither &#40;as in blithering idiot&#41;, I&#39;m fixing to start a new string dealing with an idea I have been working on to revamp the penal system. This has been in the back of my brain for years and I feel that with the proper spin, I can tie it in to the BTK case &#40;if only tenaciously&#41;. <BR> <BR>The basic concept will be: <BR> <BR>One of the basic ways to judge the quality a civilization is by its penal system &#40;paraphrased from quote by some famous person [who probably spent a lot of time in jail]&#41;. <BR> <BR>The federal government would take over the long term incarceration and administration of repeat offenders. A self-sustaining system of prisons would be built, each housing only one type of prisoner &#40;burglars,armed robbers,murderers, rapists, etc.&#41;so as to eliminate the cross-training and hardening of prisoners that takes place in general population. <BR> <BR>Each prison would also have external research and teaching facilities to allow psychologists to study and treat the prison population. <BR> <BR>In this penal utopia I can also envision communities where it would be possible to actually keep pedophiles &#40;permanently&#41;in a restricted,yet humane environment &#40;void of children&#41; and each prison would become the worldwide hub of expertise for each particular type of crime, thus making it possible to sentence criminals to &#34;grades of penalties&#34; based on their degree of severity and possibility of the redemption of the offender. <BR> <BR>The whole idea is a potential political hot potato because of state jurisdiction versus federal, but seeing that most states are being bankrupt by their prisons, most would be happy to have the Fed pick up the tab. <BR> <BR>If nothing else it will keep me out of trouble for a while...but feel free to critique. I would love to see the concept debated to death. &#40;but on the new string, not this one&#41;<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 12867-->
<!--Post: 12877--><!--Time: 1113513971-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12877"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Johno<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Johno<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, April 14, 2005 - 2:26 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Steve, Iran also does that to anyone man or woman caught with any ammount of illegal drugs and because of the availabilty and profitabilty of illegal drugs there is a lot of drugs in Iran.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
