<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12923"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Angrywolf<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Angrywolf<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, April 17, 2005 - 1:05 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Sigh..There&#39;s no deterrent.....I saw that another child was murdered in Fla by a pedophile...strangled and dumped in a pond..those people have agressive compulsive behavior...so nothing will deter them...I certainly don&#39;t thinkJohn Wayne Gacy or Ted Bundy would have been deterred by any law or constitutional Amendment..They would have tried to be more select and secretive about their crimes..maybe try to kill only singles who had no families to raise an alarm about their disappearance..or transients/street people who move around a lot and wouldn&#39;t be missed if they just vanished...But they would kill none the less...AND IGNORE ME IF YOU LIKE BUT I LIKE THIS BOARD AND WON&#39;T GO AWAY..although it appears Tom has ..and I am starting to wonder if BTK found out about his vacation and got rid of him...Tom victim #?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
