<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST13113"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Elsewhere<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Elsewhere<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, April 22, 2005 - 11:33 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->So true Vs...it&#39;s hard tho isn&#39;t it?  I look at my little dogs when I get home at night and I am so grateful that I didn&#39;t reside in Park City.  I have one that is a Cairn Terrier like TOTO and he is a barker.  He would defend me to his death and I am sure DTDC would have been out to get him if I had indeed resided in Park City.  I probably would have had many many citations from him.  But it&#39;s like when a cop goes bad...you can&#39;t hold it against all of them OR like teenagers...we had the Columbine Tragedy here...not ALL teens are Harris&#39;s and Klebold&#39;s... <BR>Teardrop, like Vs said...enjoy your favorite sandwich without letting it get to you...especially enjoy it this summer when the tomatoes are ripe<IMG SRC="http://www.catchbtk.com/discus/clipart/happy.gif" ALT=":-&#41;" BORDER=0> <BR>...they make the best BLT&#39;s...just look at this way...YOU get to thoroughly enjoy your BLT - DTDC won&#39;t being enjoying much of anything.<IMG SRC="http://www.catchbtk.com/discus/clipart/happy.gif" ALT=":-&#41;" BORDER=0> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
