</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Vscantu<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, April 22, 2005 - 6:55 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->JOHNO said; &#34;Victor, I&#39;ve stopped watching Sienfeld reruns.&#34; <BR> <BR>I knew it! Was it the &#34;Soup Nazi&#34; serving BLTs that did it? Or Kramers&#39; hair? &#40;&#34;Every time I see someones&#39; hair stand on end, I think of BTK.&#34;&#41;?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
