<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST13301"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Elsbarn<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Elsbarn<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, April 29, 2005 - 10:37 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I&#39;d like to hear if DR had the serial killer trinity as a child--bed wetting, fire fixation, cruelty to animals. I guess we&#39;ll have to wait for one of the brothers to step forward. So fat, that&#39;s about as far as we get in early warning signs, although I think pornography fixation ought to be added.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
